 (ALL): No blasts noted in differential, but leukocytosis remains unexplained", "Reactive Leukocytosis (infection): Recent cold as potential source, but magnitude of WBC elevation exceeds typical reactive patterns", "Myelodysplastic Syndrome (MDS): Anemia present but platelet count is normal, and time course is not specified as chronic"], "alarm_features": ["Unintentional weight loss", "Fatigue", "Elevated leukocyte count"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Reactive / Non-malignant Leukocytosis", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.1439051918735891, "posterior": 0.18591968269707485, "danger": 0.3, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Elevated LAP is inconsistent with CML (which typically has low LAP), weakly excluding it. This weakly supports B1 (Reactive) and weakly argues against B2."], "evidence_against": ["Leukemoid reactions typically show a left shift; a normal differential weakly contradicts this hypothesis. This weakly argues against B1 but has neutral effect…"], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.4, "interrupt_relevance": 0.2, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm (chronic/accelerated phase)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.3799097065462753, "posterior": 0.39266236985622216, "danger": 0.6, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Subacute constitutional symptoms and chronic leukocytosis align with myeloproliferative neoplasms. This weakly supports B2 (CML) but has neutral effects on oth…"], "evidence_against": ["Elevated LAP is inconsistent with CML (which typically has low LAP), weakly excluding it. This weakly supports B1 (Reactive) and weakly argues against B2."], "unresolved_questions": [